tent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391969_1738699840395231_7219042639569130772_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ScZft2L_y24Q7kNvwE9N9Pa&_nc_oc=AdqSy4elRjR6E6t0vYtR9KgjRlyWMKkY9j_C4yjTbylj0eNWMeDwpcMrt_sH9MYqx4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwXnvfY2scOMDUSw2GAfTmrbvADKucLWXw6DT4Kf8N5LA&oe=69C91DA8"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design - 2025-01-31T231303.164.png", "id": "943494907976974", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_943494914643640_3531812979695030460_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HQOUv4Gm9LcQ7kNvwE9hWU2&_nc_oc=Adq8Fx_nuj7GT6aGyAfmgbLpBl0o38hgE_Kad3HnNGi7OMzrBPgF6qk6ONoH0gff-ew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzs7dp_4N-hywMIUSD6HJB5cf-FxUMNbWU46nx0fd6Xiw&oe=69C926DF"}, {"file_name": "com.keycapgames.beautysalon-20250126-131127.png", "id": "640972868599630", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391902_640972871932963_5436091301397640580_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qCK51pTX8oQQ7kNvwETmaTe&_nc_oc=Ado2zKpUhn-s3HRv7B6JH0Oz2tl2m-Tb9P8_jyBcvUaoEN26WvV5ga9wZaKVIPpAxfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afww6h9Esmt0AsbCDnYrLzNFoXXkiET8KsOcjjt5N2YP9A&oe=69C90FB0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Beauty salon Landscape.png", "id": "1315695026239959", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392298_1315695029573292_8593302982734425761_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RoV5ZbWH1ZUQ7kNvwGQueIw&_nc_oc=Adp5_HD4Ol4rPMQvpt3DqUL513WfQ3xUkomiQ3ht2726rADMzdZRbPTmcS4rppXYpbM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzIkLAGpfvoGnisjA-2tVV6mMW5_uE3wBeEKGvJhSUu1Q&oe=69C92EB7"}, "display_name": "Beauty Salon Simulator VR", "keywords": ["Beauty", "Salon", "Makeup", "Fashion", "Shave"], "long_description": "# \u2728Features **Three** Main Sections\n\n# \ud83d\udc84Makeup Section\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f\nStep into the role of a **makeup artist**, offering a wide range of **cosmetic services**. From applying **blush, eyeshadow, mascara, glitter and liner** to switching up **hair styles, brows, lashes and eye lenses**\n{9684685488230550}\n\n**coloring** hair lashes and brow, each look is yours to create. Enhance skin with a **scrub and steam** routine, experiment with **artistic markers**. Top it off with **lipstick** classic, glossy, or glitter finishes, and personalize it further with **accessories** like **glasses, lenses, or nose piercings**. Every brushstroke offers a chance to **explore your creativity**.\n\n# \ud83d\udc85 Nails & Pedicure Section \ud83d\udc63\nOffer clients a relaxing **manicure** and **pedicure** service by **filing** and **polishing fingernails** and **toenails**, refreshing their feet with a **scrub brush**. Take it a step further by attaching **stylish nail extensions**, giving each client a personalized look that truly stands out.\n{631906926192569}\n\n\n# \ud83d\udcf8 Photography Section \ud83d\udc57\ncapture your clients' final look by letting them take **stunning photos** with a **virtual camera**, change their outfit for a unique style, and use a **green screen to switch backgrounds**. Adjust **poses and facial expressions** for the perfect shot, then **pin and store** your favorite styles on your wall of fame to celebrate your best creations.\n{552888147793719}\n\n# Early Access\nWe\u2019re planning to continuously enhancing the experience by adding more **customization options**, new **styling tools**, and a wider range of **makeup extensions**. Can't wait to hear your feedback!", "short_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual beauty salon experience! Transform your clients with a variety of makeup, pedicure tools, extensions, accessories and outfits in this creative and relaxing simulation sandbox. Customize every detail of their look, snap stunning photos, and let your imagination shine!"}]}, "develope